{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beauty Store Simulator</strong> is a unique 3D simulation game where you step into the world of cosmetics, fashion, and luxury items. You\u2019ll manage your very own beauty store, offering a wide range of products from makeup and skincare to jewelry, clothing, wigs, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store, attract customers, and become the go-to beauty destination in town. Customize displays, create stunning product arrangements, and keep up with trends to maximize sales. Handle customer satisfaction, expand your inventory, and grow your business into a thriving empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're aiming to become a beauty mogul or simply enjoy managing a stylish boutique, Beauty Store Simulator lets you build your dream store and experience the exciting world of beauty retail in a fun, interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/f97b950e9f5f62081666164e68a16289.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/f97b950e9f5f62081666164e68a16289.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/f97b950e9f5f62081666164e68a16289.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the journey doesn\u2019t stop there\u2014Beauty Store Simulator now offers even more depth with enhanced management features:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce2 Hire Influencers &amp; Streamers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your store\u2019s visibility by collaborating with popular beauty influencers for live streaming events. Watch as traffic soars and sales spike with every successful broadcast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/ec2c41a1339d7c71e286e09083ca8d64.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/ec2c41a1339d7c71e286e09083ca8d64.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/ec2c41a1339d7c71e286e09083ca8d64.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddf9 Keep It Clean</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire janitorial staff to maintain a spotless shopping environment. A clean store not only pleases customers but also helps uphold your brand\u2019s prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/6869704d2e86e3fc7350c87e8ba505fd.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/6869704d2e86e3fc7350c87e8ba505fd.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/6869704d2e86e3fc7350c87e8ba505fd.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc6e\u2642\ufe0f Security Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thieves occasionally lurk among shoppers. Employ security personnel to deter pickpockets and prevent losses, ensuring a safe experience for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/71b24a2164fd8dcc865c9323d240c96e.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/71b24a2164fd8dcc865c9323d240c96e.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/71b24a2164fd8dcc865c9323d240c96e.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude9a Streamline Operations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring in restock assistants to keep shelves fully stocked and organized. Never miss a sale due to empty displays again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d7d05e90112b5428957a4d99b553b859.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d7d05e90112b5428957a4d99b553b859.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d7d05e90112b5428957a4d99b553b859.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbc Enhance Customer Service</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire assistant managers to handle checkout efficiently, reduce waiting times, and even upsell products\u2014making every transaction smooth and profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/69408d32f3dd859e220b4ac2d6dcbca3.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/69408d32f3dd859e220b4ac2d6dcbca3.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/69408d32f3dd859e220b4ac2d6dcbca3.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc87\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Expand Your Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your beauty empire to the next level by expanding into hair salons, spa treatments, and more! As your beauty store flourishes, diversify your offerings and dominate the beauty industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/7d968511b1433f635a6685642e7eff2e.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/7d968511b1433f635a6685642e7eff2e.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/7d968511b1433f635a6685642e7eff2e.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you dream of becoming a beauty mogul or simply enjoy curating a stylish shopping experience, Beauty Store Simulator offers a fun, interactive, and richly detailed environment to build your dream store and dominate the world of beauty retail.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969150?t=1761190013","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969150?t=1761190013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/0f7e46f7916ece617ce35f869781c128b9bf95a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761190013","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/0f7e46f7916ece617ce35f869781c128b9bf95a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761190013","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3972940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beauty Store Simulator</strong> is a unique 3D simulation game where you step into the world of cosmetics, fashion, and luxury items. You\u2019ll manage your very own beauty store, offering a wide range of products from makeup and skincare to jewelry, clothing, wigs, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store, attract customers, and become the go-to beauty destination in town. Customize displays, create stunning product arrangements, and keep up with trends to maximize sales. Handle customer satisfaction, expand your inventory, and grow your business into a thriving empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're aiming to become a beauty mogul or simply enjoy managing a stylish boutique, Beauty Store Simulator lets you build your dream store and experience the exciting world of beauty retail in a fun, interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/f97b950e9f5f62081666164e68a16289.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/f97b950e9f5f62081666164e68a16289.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/f97b950e9f5f62081666164e68a16289.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the journey doesn\u2019t stop there\u2014Beauty Store Simulator now offers even more depth with enhanced management features:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce2 Hire Influencers &amp; Streamers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your store\u2019s visibility by collaborating with popular beauty influencers for live streaming events. Watch as traffic soars and sales spike with every successful broadcast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/ec2c41a1339d7c71e286e09083ca8d64.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/ec2c41a1339d7c71e286e09083ca8d64.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/ec2c41a1339d7c71e286e09083ca8d64.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddf9 Keep It Clean</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire janitorial staff to maintain a spotless shopping environment. A clean store not only pleases customers but also helps uphold your brand\u2019s prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/6869704d2e86e3fc7350c87e8ba505fd.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/6869704d2e86e3fc7350c87e8ba505fd.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/6869704d2e86e3fc7350c87e8ba505fd.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc6e\u2642\ufe0f Security Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thieves occasionally lurk among shoppers. Employ security personnel to deter pickpockets and prevent losses, ensuring a safe experience for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/71b24a2164fd8dcc865c9323d240c96e.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/71b24a2164fd8dcc865c9323d240c96e.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/71b24a2164fd8dcc865c9323d240c96e.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude9a Streamline Operations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring in restock assistants to keep shelves fully stocked and organized. Never miss a sale due to empty displays again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d7d05e90112b5428957a4d99b553b859.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d7d05e90112b5428957a4d99b553b859.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d7d05e90112b5428957a4d99b553b859.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbc Enhance Customer Service</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire assistant managers to handle checkout efficiently, reduce waiting times, and even upsell products\u2014making every transaction smooth and profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/69408d32f3dd859e220b4ac2d6dcbca3.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/69408d32f3dd859e220b4ac2d6dcbca3.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/69408d32f3dd859e220b4ac2d6dcbca3.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc87\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Expand Your Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your beauty empire to the next level by expanding into hair salons, spa treatments, and more! As your beauty store flourishes, diversify your offerings and dominate the beauty industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/7d968511b1433f635a6685642e7eff2e.poster.avif?t=1761190013\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/7d968511b1433f635a6685642e7eff2e.webm?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/7d968511b1433f635a6685642e7eff2e.mp4?t=1761190013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you dream of becoming a beauty mogul or simply enjoy curating a stylish shopping experience, Beauty Store Simulator offers a fun, interactive, and richly detailed environment to build your dream store and dominate the world of beauty retail.</p>","developers":["NovaraGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],